@RELATION lle_board_exam_clean

% Cleaned training set. Each row = one review exam taken by a student, labeled with that student's actual LLE result.
% Missing / not-taken subjects (blank or 0) are marked ?. overall = weighted average of the subjects actually taken.
% Removed: 17 post_test rows (exact copies of 2025 pre-board scores) and rows with no scores at all.

@ATTRIBUTE reference numeric
@ATTRIBUTE management numeric
@ATTRIBUTE indexing numeric
@ATTRIBUTE selection numeric
@ATTRIBUTE cataloging numeric
@ATTRIBUTE it numeric
@ATTRIBUTE overall numeric
@ATTRIBUTE board_result {FAILED,PASSED}

